e_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-80947dfb8e314a37bc520aa7a4d14f8c:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-80947dfb8e314a37bc520aa7a4d14f8c:18","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-80947dfb8e314a37bc520aa7a4d14f8c:19","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-80947dfb8e314a37bc520aa7a4d14f8c:20","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-80947dfb8e314a37bc520aa7a4d14f8c:21","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-80947dfb8e314a37bc520aa7a4d14f8c:22","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-80947dfb8e314a37bc520aa7a4d14f8c:23","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-80947dfb8e314a37bc520aa7a4d14f8c:24","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","question_text":"怎么找小红书KOC？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":22,"valid_url_cards":10,"unique_url_events":9,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"79e50175d52cde74426a677816cb8b7c64115d3cb7d4729d9c2cbc7b39c76837","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 小红书找KOC的4个渠道（KOC一般定义：**1k～1w粉**，真实普通消费者，信任度高）\n## 1. 蒲公英平台【首选，官方合规】\n小红书官方商业平台，最稳妥，适合正规报备投放\n- 入口：小红书商家后台 → 蒲公英平台 → 达人广场\n- 筛选条件：粉丝1000-10000，选择品类标签、互动率、报价、地域\n- 优点：账号可核验、合作平台留痕、笔记可报备，降低限流风险；能看历史合作笔记、粉丝画像\n- 缺点：平台抽成，报价会略高；很多极小素人KOC没入驻蒲公英\n\n## 2. 小红书站内直接挖掘（性价比最高，推荐中小品牌）\n直接在小红书APP搜关键词，自己捞野生KOC\n1. 搜**品类词、场景词、痛点词、竞品词**\n例：控油面膜、租房收纳、敏感肌护肤、XX品牌平替\n2. 重点看：自然流量笔记（不是广告），点开作者主页\n3. 筛选：主页简介留商务邮箱/合作vx；近10篇笔记内容统一、广告少\n4. 私信建联，大多支持**产品置换+少量补贴**\n> 进阶技巧：扒竞品爆款笔记，看给竞品种草的KOC；也可以从你店铺真实买家里找爱分享的用户做KOC\n\n## 3. 第三方数据工具（批量筛选、做竞品分析）\n千瓜、新红、灰豚小红书版\n- 按粉丝区间、赛道、互动率、爆文率批量筛选KOC账号\n- 查看达人过往广告笔记、粉丝画像、历史数据，快速筛刷量号\n适合：一次性批量建达人池、对标竞品投放\n\n## 4. 通告平台 / 媒介MCN（大量铺量省事）\n- 通告小程序：螃蟹通告、红人通告，发布置换/付费需求，KOC主动报名，适合铺素人KOC\n- MCN/媒介：直接交给媒介，一次性匹配一堆KOC，节省筛选时间；但会有服务费，**务必核验账号真假**，小心刷量号\n\n# 📌 KOC筛选核心标准（避坑重点，别看只粉丝）\n1. **互动率**：KOC优质区间 **5%-10%**，优先看收藏率（小红书种草看收藏）\n2. 看**最近10篇笔记**：内容是否统一，广告笔记占比不要太高（广告太多像营销号）\n3. 看评论：评论是否口语自然，不是统一模板灌水，有没有真实提问\n4. 粉丝画像：年龄、性别、地域和你的目标客群匹配\n5. 避坑：数据断层（某篇突然几万赞，其余几十赞，大概率刷量）\n\n# 💡 合作方式\nKOC大多两种模式：\n- **置换**：寄产品，免费试用，博主写笔记（适合几百～几千粉素人KOC）\n- **置换+小额费用**：产品+几百元补贴，内容质量更高\n\n> 提醒：私下私信合作**不能平台报备**，有笔记限流风险；商业投放想稳妥优先走蒲公英报备。\n","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-0cef32c6ac314de48d77183f55240187:1","title":"小红书投放去哪里找靠谱 KOC 腰部博主?_广告行业问答_问答_传播易","raw_url":"https://m.chuanboyi.com/wenda/show/431.html","normalized_url":"https://m.chuanboyi.com/wenda/show/431.html","host":"m.chuanboyi.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-0cef32c6ac314de48d77183f55240187:2","title":"月发布一万篇笔记的pr是如何合作koc的 #安老板 #安老板全链路回流打法 #koc种草 #koc合作 #小红书获客","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680139864616029503","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680139864616029503","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-0cef32c6ac314de48d77183f55240187:3","title":"商家品牌如何找koc、kol博主合作。#koc #kol #品牌方 #博主 #品牌推广","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7630743718768725248","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7630743718768725248","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-0cef32c6ac314de48d77183f55240187:4","title":"小红书KOC/KOL资源怎么找。#实用技巧分享 #创作者中心 #创作灵感 #小红书素人推广 #小红书达人推广","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660439991630707834","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7660439991630707834","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0141","question_id":"CQ-Q0141","citation_id":"smp-0cef32c6ac314de48d77183f55240187:5","title":"KOC Marketing Playbook: The 80/20 Strategy for XHS Success | Xiaohongshu 